              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yosevu atheew’a Misili; na Votivali, mũnene ũmwe wa kwa Valao, kavuteni wa nguthu ya asũvĩi, Mũmisili, amũthooa kw’okonĩ kwa Aisumaeli, ala mamũtheeisye kũu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
