        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, vwana wake eew’a ndeto sya mũka, ila wamũtavisye, akĩmwĩa, Mũthũkũmi waku nũmbĩkie ũndũ ũilyĩ ũu; ũthilĩku wake wookĩla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
